      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm, had a problem with uploading avatars, where it would upload all data but not the avatar itself. \nCouldn't figure out what was causing it, so downgrading and upgrading my unity project caused it to show me my math was down by 1 minor version. Updated that and it fixed my problem.",
