      "value": "I experienced the same issue on a fresh project with only the new beta SDK imported. It seemed to work at first but when I restarted Unity, it gave me the same issue.\nI also had no luck importing the new SDK over the old one I had in my previous project.\nEDIT: I found out Pumpkins Avatar Tools was breaking the new SDK. I deleted it and it worked after",
