      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I don't **nor did I ever** use PAT. I did use Lyuma, and removing that did fix a *similar* issue, despite being a \"compatible\" release, but that was *post* project rebuild (from scratch) and the errors weren't the same.\n \n(The **matching** errors were in the same cursed project that removing the analytics cache would fix-per-play the editor, if you recall. Rebuilding the project from scratch caused similar errors relating to mathematics until I reimported Lyuma from scratch, but they were different in scope. I cannot say whether it was Lyuma causing the initial issues.)",
