      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "**if you were using a beta sdk from a while ago**\nIf you import the newest Avatar Dynamics SDK on top of an old one, you'll likely see some errors. To fix them delete the specific file: Assets\\VRCSDK\\SDK3A\\Editor\\PhysboneMigration.cs.\nhttps://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/503009489486872583/951666243969093673\nJust helped someone in the AV3 help channel with the same issue. They were updating from the first weeks beta sdk.",
