      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This isse immediately after creating a new project and importing the SDK from VRChat Creator Companion.\n\nThis's not a problem with Pumkins Avatar Tools.\n\nUpdating the Burst and Mathematics packages doesn't fix it.\n\nThere's a problem with VRChat Creator Companion itself.",
